{
  "about": "Probes for the INFO functions (docs/formats/dax-functions.md, \"INFO functions\"). Each entry is placed in a synthetic model as its role says: measure `Probe` on table `Sales`, calculated column `Probe` of `Sales`, calculated table `Probe Table`, or a DAX query against the base model. Record for each: accepted (definition state Ready or a query that runs), the error class if not, and for queries the result columns (name and type) and the first row. Model: crates/dax/tests/oracle/model.bim saved as a PBIX with data, so RefreshedTime is set.",
